[CENTER][SIZE=6][B]Expressive Launcher 4.1.0 (Build 59) — Now You See It, Now You Don't[/B][/SIZE]
[SIZE=4][I]Official Release Announcement & Download Links[/I][/SIZE][/CENTER]

[HR][/HR]

Three improvements straight from community feedback in our Telegram group. Thank you for the detailed list!

[SIZE=5][B]✨ What's New & Improved[/B][/SIZE]

1. [B]One-tap Hide in the app drawer[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Long-press any app in the app drawer (or its suggestions row) and choose [B]Hide[/B]. It disappears from the drawer immediately.
[*]Changed your mind? Tap [B]Undo[/B] on the bar that appears at the bottom of the screen.
[*]Before, hiding took three taps through Customize. Hide only appears for apps opened from the drawer, and never while the Home screen is locked.

[/LIST]
2. [B]No more accidental folder-to-widget conversions[/B]:
[LIST]
[*]Inside an open Home folder, the button next to the folder name is now a [B]⋮ menu[/B]. [B]Make widget[/B] (or [B]Make normal folder[/B] for a Folder widget) lives inside it, so converting always takes a deliberate second tap.

[/LIST]
3. [B]Transparent search bar while scrolling[/B] (new option):
[LIST]
[*]New switch in [B]Settings → App list → Transparent search bar while scrolling[/B].
[*]When it's on, the area behind the app drawer search bar stays see-through as you scroll, instead of filling in with a solid band. The search field keeps its own background so it stays easy to read. Off by default.

[/LIST]
[QUOTE]😄 Your apps can now play hide-and-seek. Unlike real hide-and-seek, there's an Undo button for when nobody can find them.

📁 Folders were getting promoted to widgets without asking. They now need a ⋮ second opinion.[/QUOTE]

[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]💬 Community Notes[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]Folder icon size[/B]: we couldn't reproduce folder icons ignoring the icon-size setting on the default grid (folder icons scaled with Home at 1.4×). If you still see it, please share your device, grid and whether the folder is on Home or in the app drawer in @ExpressiveLauncherFeedback.
[*][B]Free trial for Pro[/B]: great suggestion. We're designing a time-limited trial for an upcoming 4.1.x release.

[/LIST]
[HR][/HR]

[SIZE=5][B]🧩 Release Riddle[/B][/SIZE]

I vanish with one tap and return with another; I'm in your drawer, then I'm not, but never truly gone. What am I?
[SPOILER="Click to reveal the answer"]A hidden app — one tap on [B]Hide[/B], one tap on [B]Undo[/B]! 🙈[/SPOILER]

[HR][/HR]

